./contributingGuides/FORMS.md:191:When any form field fails to validate in addition to the inline error below a field, an error message will also appear inline above the submit button indicating that some fields need to be fixed. A “fix the errors” link will scroll the user to the first input that needs attention and focus on it (putting the cursor at the end of the existing value). By default, on form submit and when tapping the “fix the errors” link we should scroll the user to the first field that needs their attention.
